      "text": "This six-day route takes you through the historic centre of San Salvador, volcanic parks, the Route of Flowers, Tazumal, Santa Ana, Joya de Cerén and Suchitoto. The programme includes an outing on Lake Suchitlán and a chance to meet local artisans. An English-speaking guide accompanies you."
